# FloorBeat platform map (updated 2026-10-24)

Full details: `docs/ENVIRONMENTS.md` in the backend repo (`~/esp-intro/backend`) and the personal-store memory file
`esp-iot-platform-memory.md`.

## Repos
- Firmware: `~/esp-intro` (`esp-iot-firmware`). Backend: `~/esp-intro/backend` (nested git, `esp-iot-backend-stack`).
- Frontend + marketing site: `~/esp-iot-frontend` (`esp-iot-frontend`); marketing lives in `marketing/`
  (`~/floorbeat-site` is an old, unused copy).

## Environments (all on Hetzner `esp-iot` = 162.55.168.191, one factory each)

| | Prod | Stage | Dev |
|---|---|---|---|
| Branch | `main` | `staging` | `develop` |
| Marketing | `floorbeat.in` | `stage-www.floorbeat.in` | `dev-www.floorbeat.in` |
| Dashboard | `app.floorbeat.in` | `stage-app.floorbeat.in` | `dev-app.floorbeat.in` |
| Staff console | `ops.floorbeat.in` | `stage-ops.floorbeat.in` | `dev-ops.floorbeat.in` |
| API | `api.floorbeat.in` | `api-stage.floorbeat.in` | `api-dev.floorbeat.in` |
| Server dir / port | `/root/backend` / 8001 | `/root/backend-stage` / 8101 | `/root/backend-dev` / 8201 |
| Factory | `factory-01` (real ESP `revb-304ad0` + mock looms 5–20) | `factory-pune-01` | `factory-mumbai-02` |

- Stage/dev use `docker-compose.nonprod.yml` (Postgres, query-api, aggregator, mock producer writing to
  Postgres; no MQTT/Redpanda, alerts and email off). Their `.env` files are server-only, never in CI.
- Prod `.env` has `SEED_FACTORY_IDS=none`; Pune/Mumbai were removed from prod (backup in `/root/backups/`).
- Caddy proxies api-stage → 8101, api-dev → 8201.

## Deploy flow
- Promote `develop` → `staging` → `main`. Prod-facing fixes: push the same commit to all three.
- Backend: `deploy.yml` (main → prod), `deploy-nonprod.yml` (develop/staging → rsync + `scripts/deploy-nonprod.sh`).
- Frontend: `deploy.yml` deploys Workers per branch (prod envs default/`app`; `stage`/`stage-app`; `dev`/`dev-app`).
  `deploy-marketing.yml` runs only on `marketing/**` changes (`--env stage|dev` off main).
- Wrangler: use `--env <name>` only; never pass the Worker name too. New-Worker deploy error 10007 → rerun.
- Branch pushes with only ignored paths don't trigger CI; use `workflow_dispatch`.

## Behaviour to preserve
- `GET /v1/public/factories/:id` (no auth) → `{factory_id,name}` or 404 `{error:'Factory not found'}`.
  Marketing `/login` and app `/f/:id/login` show "factory not found" instead of redirecting.
- Marketing CSP `form-action` must include `APP_ORIGIN`. Non-prod marketing sends `X-Robots-Tag: noindex`.
- Session hint cookie `fb_home` only in prod (`SESSION_HINT_COOKIE_DOMAIN`).
- Factory sidebar order is `DEFAULT_TABS` in frontend `src/lib/factory-config.ts`
  (Overview, Status Timeline, Availability, Alerts, ...).

## Email
- Inbox: Zoho Mail (free) on `floorbeat.in`; MX/SPF/DKIM/DMARC in Cloudflare DNS.
- Sending (Resend): shift reports `FloorBeat Reports <reports@>`, board alerts `FloorBeat Alerts <alerts@>`,
  welcome emails `FloorBeat <hello@>`; replies to `support@floorbeat.in`. admin@/alerts@/hello@/reports@/support@
  are Zoho aliases of ashutosh@floorbeat.in. Bounce webhook `POST https://api.floorbeat.in/v1/webhooks/resend`.
- Email layout, footer and design rules: `floorbeat-emails.mdc` / `backend/docs/EMAILS.md`.

## Secrets
Never print or commit secrets. Read them with hidden input (`read -rs`) or pipe them over ssh into `gh secret set`.
